# s83o: staircase via walk/release/hop cycles (s83n proved RELEASE leaves player
# alive at gap edge 057C; knockback breaks cam->world offset so cam-locked hops
# misland). Each cycle: walk 30f, RELEASE, hop B8 45f (never walk off an edge).
